	(text "U11 NXP SC16IS740IPW: I²C1 slave at 0x48 (A1 = A0 = VDD; INA226s 0x40-0x45, TCA9535 0x20).\nTX / RX → servo UART terminal (AuxPower sheet, 100 Ω + ESD there) → FE-URT-2.\nY1 16 MHz (CL 9 pF) + C43 / C44 12 pF: baud = 16 MHz / (16 × divisor):\n1 Mbit/s (Feetech default, divisor 1), 500k (2), 250k (4) are exact.\nIRQ not connected (no module pin free): poll the LSR / RXLVL registers.\nCTS tied low (always clear), RTS open, RESET pulled up (soft reset via IOControl).\nUses no module GPIO, so the MES4 standard pin map stays intact."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 204.47 121.92 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "477af9f0-bffe-51c8-8c80-96377b52a69d")
	)
